Display comprehensive information about a specific course.
Show course progress and completion status for the user.
Provide access to course content and curriculum.
Allow users to resume learning from the last accessed point.
Display instructor information and course ratings.
Offer options to share the course with others.
Present student reviews and feedback.
Show course duration, difficulty level, and enrollment statistics.
Provide a clear overview of what the course covers and learning outcomes.
Enable navigation to individual lessons or modules.
