Course title, description, and learning objectives.
Course progress indicator showing overall completion percentage.
"Resume Learning" button to continue from the last accessed lesson.
Course metadata: rating, number of students, lessons, duration, and instructor.
Instructor profile with name, title, and number of students taught.
"Share this Course" functionality with social media and link options.
"About this Course" section outlining key skills and outcomes.
Expandable course curriculum with modules, lessons, and estimated durations.
Checkmarks indicating completed lessons.
"Student Reviews" section with ratings, comments, and timestamps.
Course difficulty label (e.g., Beginner).
Course tags (e.g., Python).
Certificate of Completion eligibility and requirements.
Estimated time to complete the course.
Navigation breadcrumb (e.g., My Courses > Python for Beginners).


