## Page Name: User Profile
Page Requirements:
Display user profile information, including name, role, and learning interests.
Show user achievements, such as courses completed, study hours, topics mastered, problems solved, certificates earned, and community contributions.
Provide access to user certificates, badges, goals, and contributions.
Allow users to edit their profile and share it with others.
Display active goals and progress tracking.
Provide account settings, preferences, and privacy options.
Enable users to manage their email, phone number, password, and language settings.
Offer options to delete the account and associated data.
