User profile section with name, role, learning interests, and profile picture.
"Edit Profile" and "Share Profile" buttons.
Achievements section displaying courses completed, total study hours, topics mastered, problems solved, certificates earned, and community contributions.
Certificates section with links to view certificates for completed courses.
Active Goals section with progress tracking for goals such as mastering algorithms, building projects, and reading books.
Account Settings section for managing email, phone number, and password.
Preferences section for language, theme, and notification settings.
Privacy section for profile visibility, showing achievements, and two-factor authentication.
"Delete Account" option to permanently delete the account and associated data.
Navigation to other sections of the platform.